# auth.md

Agents can read Shrinath Prabhu’s portfolio and blog without signing in.

## Registration and credentials

The public REST API and website are open to anonymous readers. Omit the `Authorization` header and cookies. The site has no account registration or credential provisioning endpoint.

## Read public content

Use `GET` to read a page or `HEAD` to check its headers. For example, this request returns the blog index as Markdown:

```sh
curl -fsS -H 'Accept: text/markdown' https://shrinath.me/blog/
```

Start with [GET /api/blogs](https://shrinath.me/api/blogs), then follow an entry’s `apiUrl` to read its Markdown. [GET /api/me](https://shrinath.me/api/me) returns the public profile. The routes share an allowance of 12 requests per IP per minute at each Cloudflare location.

The [content index](https://shrinath.me/content-index.json) lists each page’s canonical and Markdown URLs. The [agent guide](https://shrinath.me/agents/) explains content formats and HTTP errors.
